%% Trace: FR-01, FR-03-FR-04, FR-14, FR-19-FR-21, FR-28-FR-29, FR-39, FR-46, FR-55, FR-59, FR-61, FR-68; SC-05, SC-06
%% UX / server responsibilities are labelled. API keys are relative to /api. Policy and runtime evidence remain unapproved.
flowchart TD
    Unable["Generic unable-to-deliver state: no answer, no source reason; user may ask again"]
    Start["Protected read or AI request"]
    Session{"Valid authenticated session?"}
    Login["401: sign-in"]
    Member{"Workspace confirms current project membership?"}
    NotFound["Generic 404: same unknown/inaccessible body; no title, count, version or excerpt"]
    Authority["Unknown / failed authority: deny output, generic service error"]
    Type{"Resource / operation?"}
    Work["Task / board: permitted read; controls depend on separate action capabilities"]
    Doc["Document / version / exact citation: current authoritative checks"]
    Draft{"Draft direct read?"}
    Write{"Current project membership + content-write + applicable document checks?"}
    Classification{"Classification?"}
    Grant{"Restricted: current explicit read grant?"}
    Allowed["Knowledge checks exact version, passage and availability inside protected-read handoff guard"]
    View["Return exact permitted source; historical labels; no substitution"]
    Unavailable["Specific Citation unavailable only with surviving-identity permission; otherwise generic 404; API mapping open"]
    QRead["1. Authorised retrieval: project-shared OR restricted with grant; current membership; Current-only default; no Draft"]
    PreModel["2. Guarded current access + Knowledge validity through provider transport handoff"]
    Buffer["Generate outside guard; buffer all output; validate exact evidence identities"]
    PreAnswer["3. Guarded session/access/validity of entire evidence set through response transport handoff"]
    Valid{"All evidence still permitted and valid?"}
    Answer["Deliver answer / conflict with verified citations"]
    Withhold["Reject revoked provider input or withhold entire original draft; no protected content or source reason"]
    Citation["4. Open citation: re-enter authenticated protected-read flow using exact locator"]
    Insufficient["Insufficient evidence; no hidden-source or Draft explanation"]
    Failure["Explicit AI failure; keyword/docs fallback only if Knowledge healthy; Workspace work if healthy"]
    Boundary["Event: Revocation/removal commit shares handoff guard; restricted grants never revive on rejoin; already sent data cannot be recalled"]
    Start --> Session
    Session -->|No| Login
    Session -->|Yes| Member
    Member -->|No| NotFound
    Member -->|Unknown / failed| Authority
    Member -->|Yes| Type
    Type -->|Task / board| Work
    Type -->|Source / citation| Doc
    Doc --> Draft
    Draft -->|Yes| Write
    Write -->|Permitted| Allowed
    Write -->|Denied| NotFound
    Draft -->|No| Classification
    Classification -->|project-shared| Allowed
    Classification -->|restricted| Grant
    Classification -->|Unknown| Authority
    Grant -->|Yes| Allowed
    Grant -->|No| NotFound
    Grant -->|Check error| Authority
    Allowed -->|Available| View
    Allowed -->|Missing evidence| Unavailable
    Allowed -->|Check error| Authority
    Type -->|AI Q&A| QRead
    QRead -->|Insufficient| Insufficient
    QRead -->|Sufficient| PreModel
    QRead -->|Check failed| Authority
    PreModel -->|Handoff permitted| Buffer
    PreModel -->|Evidence revoked| Withhold
    PreModel -->|Check failed| Authority
    Buffer -->|Complete| PreAnswer
    Buffer -->|Dependency failed| Failure
    PreAnswer --> Valid
    PreAnswer -->|Check failed| Authority
    Valid -->|Yes| Answer
    Valid -->|No| Withhold
    Withhold -->|Retry chosen with budget and safe evidence; repeat all checks| QRead
    Answer --> Citation
    Citation --> Session
    Boundary --> PreModel
    Boundary --> PreAnswer
    Withhold -->|No retry, budget exhausted or no safe evidence| Unable
